  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">La Pepiniere: Programme for adolescent girls in the Democratic Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the economic empowerment of women and girls, and in particular adolescent girls, in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) by supporting projects that pilot new approaches to economic empowerment. This contributes towards Millennium Development Goal 3 (Promote gender equality and empower women)To increase the economic empowerment of women and girls, particularly adolescent girls, by supporting pilot approaches with potential to transform social norms and developing an evidence base about what works. This contributes to Millennium Development Goal 3 (promote gender equality and empower women)</narrative>
  </description>
